    "user_title": "Build Azure Event Hubs Clients in Python",
    "value_statement": "Reliable event streaming requires correct authentication, batching, partitioning, and checkpointing. This skill provides practical Python SDK patterns for producers, consumers, and asynchronous workflows.",
